{"kind":"notes","id":"nt/syodff","slideIndex":2,"text":"Game artwork: Kenney Top-down Tanks pack, supplied in the project assets folder. Content: Ilyas Akinola’s project brief and finalproject.py.\nTerminology: random is a Python standard-library module. pygame is a library. now is a variable calculated as pygame.time.get_ticks() / 1000, giving elapsed time since Pygame initialization, not a clock time or a library. Rect.colliderect() tests rectangle overlap, not the exact painted outlines of sprites. POWERUP_DURATION is five seconds; a shield is consumed when it blocks a hit."}
