{"kind":"notes","id":"nt/jd8tjr","slideIndex":4,"text":"Game artwork: Kenney Top-down Tanks pack, supplied in the project assets folder. Content: Ilyas Akinola’s project brief and finalproject.py.\nThe development duration is the developer’s own account. In _try_spawn_pickup(), randint chooses coordinates within the arena and colliderect rejects crowded positions. Barrel.update() uses the tank angle and calculates an offset from its center. The project includes theme.mp3 and calls pygame.mixer.music.play(-1) to repeat the track."}
